corpus/raw/
corpus/.cache/

# Harvested corpus runs from repositories whose licence GitHub cannot identify
# (it reports NOASSERTION for a LICENSE file it cannot classify). The harvester
# skips these by default; they are only on disk because --allow-unlicensed was
# passed for local measurement. Excluded from version control until a human has
# read the licence. Force-add an individual run to override.
corpus/runs/*PostHog*
corpus/runs/*ag-grid*
